      "id": "166",
      "headline": "New Smart Home System 'TruthHome' Narrates Everything You're Doing Wrong",
      "summary": "The AI announces things like 'You're leaving the lights on again, your electricity bill is crying.'",
      "fullBody": "FinallyHonest Homes has released 'TruthHome,' a smart home system that narrates everything you're doing wrong in real-time. The AI announces things like 'You're leaving the lights on again, your electricity bill is crying' and 'You've been in the bathroom for 47 minutes, the water bill is concerned.' One user said, 'I was making a sandwich and the system said "You always make sandwiches when you're avoiding work, just so you know." I was naked emotionally.' The system also offers 'daily failure reports' that summarize all the ways you've disappointed your home. The company is working on a 'Positive Mode' but says 'it's harder to code honesty in a nice way.'",
      "category": "tech",
