      "id": "168",
      "headline": "New App 'Replace My Relationships' Uses AI To Maintain All Your Friendships For You",
      "summary": "The 'SocialShadow' system texts your friends on your behalf, making plans and pretending to care.",
      "fullBody": "Friendship Maintenance Technologies has released 'SocialShadow,' an AI system that maintains all your friendships by texting people on your behalf with appropriate levels of interest and care. The AI responds to messages like 'Hey, how's it going?' with 'Pretty good, how about you?' and schedules hangouts with 'We should hang out sometime, maybe next week?' without any intention of following through. One user said, 'I've had the same 3 friends since high school and SocialShadow has been handling all communication for 2 years. They think I'm 'busy but still around.' I'm actually just playing video games.' The AI also sends birthday messages and responds to life events with 'That's great, I'm so happy for you' even when it has no idea what's happening.",
      "category": "tech",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-10/168.jpg",
