      "id": "170",
      "headline": "New AI 'Gym Motivation Bot' That Only Messages You When You're Making Excuses",
      "summary": "The 'FitCheckAI' sends messages like 'I see you bought gym shoes 47 days ago and never used them, what's that about?'",
      "fullBody": "BrutalFitness Tech has released 'FitCheckAI,' a motivation bot that monitors your behavior and sends messages when you're making excuses not to exercise. The AI sends notifications like 'I see you bought gym shoes 47 days ago and never used them, what's that about?' and 'You said you'd start Monday, it's now the 47th Monday, when's the actual start date?' One user said, 'I was about to skip the gym and the AI sent a video of me from 3 months ago saying 'this time will be different' and then showed me my current self. I went to the gym immediately.' The bot has been credited with 'finally getting people to actually work out' and criticized for 'being too aggressive with its honesty.'",
      "category": "tech",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-10/170.jpg",
